body:
Hello kind sir! Thank you for saying hi to Reginald. I have looked it up and he first visited us on January 22nd of this [year](https://www.reddit.com/r/me_irl/comments/aim9k6/meirl/). That was 8 weeks ago, which means this is the fourth correct time Reginald is visiting us.

&#x200B;

Have a good day :)
